 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In this town, every school has twelve floors.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]"
  },
  {
   "text": "But sometimes, the elevator shows a thirteenth.",
   "tag": "[ominous]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody knows where it leads.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]"
  },
  {
   "text": "And teachers warn students never to press it.",
   "tag": "[serious]",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "text": "One afternoon, a boy named Ryan stayed late after class.",
   "tag": "[curious]"
  },
  {
   "text": "When he entered the elevator, a new button appeared.",
   "tag": "[intrigued]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Floor thirteen.",
   "tag": "[whispers]",
   "pause": 0.4
  },
  {
   "text": "He pressed it.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "The elevator began moving upward.",
   "tag": "[tense]"
  },
  {
   "text": "But it didn't stop.",
   "tag": "[uneasy]",
   "pause": 0.4
  },
  {
   "text": "After five minutes, the doors finally opened.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Ryan stepped into a classroom.",
   "tag": "[uneasy]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every desk was occupied.",
   "tag": "[uneasy]"
  },
  {
   "text": "And every student looked exactly like him.",
   "tag": "[fearful]",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "text": "Suddenly, the teacher turned around.",
   "tag": "[tense]"
  },
  {
   "text": "She was an older version of Ryan.",
   "tag": "[shocked]"
  },
  {
   "text": "She smiled and said,",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "“You're late again.”",
   "speak": "You're late again.",
   "voice": "teacher",
   "tag": "[warmly, eerie]",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "text": "Ryan tried to run back into the elevator.",
   "tag": "[urgent]"
  },
  {
   "text": "But the doors had vanished.",
   "tag": "[fearful]",
   "pause": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the school bell rang.",
   "tag": "[tense]"
  },
  {
   "text": "And every student whispered together,",
   "tag": "[whispers]",
   "pause": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "“Welcome back, Ryan.”",
   "speak": "Welcome back, Ryan.",
   "voice": "students",
   "tag": "[whispers]",
   "fx": "chorus",
   "pause": 0.5
  },
  {
